"San Angelo has warmed, days and nights alike","p_chg":"Across 101 complete years: San Angelo's average low has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.16\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.08 to +0.24), about +1.9\u00b0F since 1908. San Angelo's average high has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.16\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.04 to +0.28), about +1.9\u00b0F since 1908.","t_mon":"Lows rose in 9 of 12 months. Highs rose in 2 of 12 months.","t_rain":"San Angelo has gotten wetter","p_rain":"San Angelo's yearly precipitation has risen <strong class='sig'>+0.80 inches per decade</strong> (95% range +0.20 to +1.41), about +6.4 inches since 1945. The 1991\u20132020 normal is 20.9 inches a year. The wettest year was 2016 (35.72 in); the driest, 1956 (7.41 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":false,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 12 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}